OL,3,GNEWSAResidents advised to close windows
OL,4,Aas fire service tackled blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents were earlier asked to keep
OL,7,Ftheir windows and doors closed as
OL,8,Ffirefighters tackled a blaze at a
OL,9,Fderelict building in County Antrim.
OL,11,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService (NIFRS) said crews were
OL,13,Fattending the fire on Cloughfern Avenue
OL,14,Fin Monkstown Industrial Estate.
OL,16,FSeven Fire Appliances from Glengormley,
OL,17,FWhitla, Central, Westland, Ballyclare
OL,18,FFire Stations, an Aerial Appliance from
OL,19,FSpringfield Fire Station along with a
OL,20,FCommand Support Unit from Lisburn Fire
OL,21,FStation all attended.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
